<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-CNF Transport estimate raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-CNF Transport estimate raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Gruntal &amp; Co said Friday it raised its earnings estimate for CNF Transport Co in fiscal 1997 to $1.85 from $1.80 in light of the strength in domestic air cargo and the continuing business improvement for less-than-truckload shippers in general.</p>
<p>-- Gruntal also reiterated its long-term outperform rating for the company and set a new price target of $25.</p>
<p>-- CNF Transport provides shipping services.</p>
<p>-- Its shares were up 1-1/2 Friday at 26-5/8.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
